## CUSTOM RULES (Add application-specific rules here)
## ============================================================================

# Example: Allow monitoring agents to phone home
# pass out inet proto tcp to { 1.2.3.4, 5.6.7.8 } port 9090 keep state

# Example: Allow inbound SNMP monitoring
# pass in inet proto udp to any port 161 keep state

